OVERVIEW: Check server status

Check if the DICOM server is running and responsive.

USAGE: dicom-server status [--host <host>] [--port <port>] [--calling-ae <calling-ae>] [--called-ae <called-ae>] [--verbose]

OPTIONS:
  -h, --host <host>       Server host (default: localhost)
  -p, --port <port>       Server port (default: 11112)
  --calling-ae <calling-ae>
                          Calling AE Title (default: DICOM_ECHO)
  --called-ae <called-ae> Called AE Title (default: DICOMKIT_SCP)
  -v, --verbose           Verbose output
  --version               Show the version.
  -h, --help              Show help information.

